{
 "encounter_id": "00587",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Come in, Brendan, sit down. I have the note from your last visit here, and it seems Maureen is worried about your weight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "She is, doctor, and so am I now, to be honest. I can't stop thinking about it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Tell me in your own words what's been happening."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm losing weight. My trousers are hanging off me, and the belt's on the last hole now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Since when, roughly?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About three months. Maybe a bit longer. Is that very bad? Should I be worried?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's find out first. Has your appetite changed?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm off my food, yeah. Maureen did a roast on Sunday and I couldn't finish it, which never happens."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else you've noticed alongside that?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm tired too. Wrecked by the afternoon, even when I've done nothing at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any vomiting at all?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blood in your stool, or black motions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Not that I've seen. Is that something I should be looking for?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's a standard question. What about a cough that won't shift?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No cough. My chest has been grand."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had fevers?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fevers. I'd be at the thermometer all day, I'm that anxious."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any trouble swallowing your food?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, it all goes down fine. I just don't want it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What about passing water, any trouble there?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, that's all normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Let's go through your health history. What are you being treated for?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure and high cholesterol. And an underactive thyroid. And reflux, now and then."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what tablets are you on for those?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ramipril, 5 mg once a day, for the blood pressure. And atorvastatin, 20 mg at night, for the cholesterol."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the third one?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The thyroid tablet. 75 micrograms, maybe? I'd have to look at the box to be sure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fair enough, we'll check that. Have you had any surgery over the years?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I had my appendix out when I was twelve. And a knee replacement about six years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. I came out in a rash all over, years ago. My mother never let me forget it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. Is there anything serious in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had bowel cancer. And my mother had a stroke. That's why I'm so on edge about all this."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's understandable. Do you smoke, Brendan?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I stopped smoking fifteen years ago. Twenty a day for years before that, though."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I drink a couple of pints on a Saturday, and that's the height of it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work, or are you retired?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Retired, I was a postman for thirty years. I live with Maureen, just the two of us now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, let me take your vitals, and then have a feel of your tummy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure 138 over 84, pulse 88, temperature 36.8 degrees Celsius, oxygen 97 percent, and your weight is 71 kilograms.",
   "pause": 15
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that good or bad?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mostly fine. The weight is the one that tells the story. Now lie back for me.",
   "pause": 10
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your tummy is soft and there's no tenderness. There are no lumps in your neck either.",
   "pause": 18
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank God. So what is it, doctor?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can't say for sure yet. My leading suspicion is that your thyroid tablet is a bit too strong for you, which can cause weight loss."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And the bowel cancer, with my father? I keep thinking about it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We're going to rule things out properly. I'll order blood tests today, including your thyroid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like a stool sample too, to be thorough, given your father's history. I'll give you a pot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. Is there anything I should be doing in the meantime?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Three things. Eat little and often, add full-fat milk and butter where you can, and weigh yourself once a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Weekly. Maureen will love that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And don't change any tablets yourself. Bring the thyroid box in so we can check the dose."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you lose any more weight before the results are back, ring me straight away and I'll see you sooner."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will, doctor. Thank you, I feel a little calmer now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good man. Mind yourself, and say hello to Maureen for me."
  }
 ],
